{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/857009-lfp-werewolf-the-apocalypse","id":857009,"title":"LFP - Werewolf the Apocalypse","path":["Home","Onyx Path","General","Conventions, Gatherings, and Online Play"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-04-01T00:49:54-07:00","id":857009,"title":"LFP - Werewolf the Apocalypse","content":"Evening, everyone. I'm looking for 3-4 players for a Werewolf: the Apocalypse (20th Anniversary) game. We'll be using <a href=\"https://discordapp.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Discord</a> (voice not required).<br /> <br /> The date and time will be worked out once we've got a group. My timezone is EST and I'm usually available anywhere from noon to midnight on weekdays.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11550-cinnabar","name":"Cinnabar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11550_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-01T00:51:47-07:00","id":857010,"title":"","content":"I would but I'm no where near available when you are for the foreseeable future.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3953-dwight","name":"Dwight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3953_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2355"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-01T12:17:53-07:00","id":857231,"title":"","content":"I <i>could</i> do something in the morning hours, if that would work best for everyone involved. My weekends are also more open.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11550-cinnabar","name":"Cinnabar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11550_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-04T17:55:19-07:00","id":859351,"title":"","content":"I'm still looking for players. Everything is set up and ready to go. If you're interested, please PM me for an invite to the game.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11550-cinnabar","name":"Cinnabar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11550_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-10T12:08:57-07:00","id":863252,"title":"","content":"My search continues!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11550-cinnabar","name":"Cinnabar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11550_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-10T12:16:10-07:00","id":863257,"title":"","content":"I'd play but I don't wanna get yet another software. I can do Skype, Roll20, Google Hangouts or even Razor.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/576-ephsy","name":"Ephsy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar576_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2615"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-13T20:57:53-07:00","id":865308,"title":"","content":"You wouldn't need to download it. Discord can run in your browser, and you don't even need to sign up for an account (although that helps).<br /> <br /> I might be able to work with Skype, but it often crashes on me for no discernible reason. I'll look into Roll20 as well.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11550-cinnabar","name":"Cinnabar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11550_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-14T03:53:33-07:00","id":865396,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Cinnabar</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/857009-lfp-werewolf-the-apocalypse?p=865308#post865308\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">You wouldn't need to download it. Discord can run in your browser, and you don't even need to sign up for an account (although that helps).<br /> <br /> I might be able to work with Skype, but it often crashes on me for no discernible reason. I'll look into Roll20 as well.</div> </div> </div> </div>Alright, send me a message when you have something set up.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/576-ephsy","name":"Ephsy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar576_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2615"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-16T21:07:31-07:00","id":866650,"title":"","content":"I sent you a private message but I wanted to send a post about my interest here also. I am interested and would be very excited to get into your game. I first played WtA back in the `90s when I grabbed it off the store shelves and have been reading the W20 version lately and wanted to try it out again. I can make most days and times, except very early hours of the morning, unless it is on Thursday/Friday - Saturday. I haven't played the game any since College but I want to. I am central time zone so EST is only 1 hr ahead/difference for me. I am also capable of playing more then once a week.<br /> <br /> - Aeternal","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5256-aeternal","name":"Aeternal","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-12T14:32:21-08:00","id":1002359,"title":"","content":"Is this ongoing?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12191-malus","name":"Malus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12191_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1562"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-29T07:19:24-08:00","id":1009760,"title":"","content":"Hey how's it going? I started a Facebook group for White Wolf game play media and subject matter media but we also allow people who are trying to run a game post looking for players too. The only thing we ask is the following;<br /> <br /> 1)Be specific on the game type, and theme of the game<br /> 2)Be specific on what you will allow and not allow<br /> 3)The means in which you plan to run the game, and when.<br /> 4)The more details the better.<br /> <br /> Hope to see you there<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/groups/862703457198327/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://lookaside.fbsbx.com/lookaside/crawler/media/?media_id=862703457198327\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/groups/862703457198327/\" target=\"_blank\"> World of Darkness and Onyx Path RPGs Game Play and Media | Facebook </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/groups/862703457198327/\" target=\"_blank\"> https://www.facebook.com/groups/862703457198327/ </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> We want this place to almost be like a Netflix for White Wolf and Onyx Path RPGs; A one-stop shop where someone can find recorded/streamed gameplay or articles to kill time, and also for content... </div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>For different game play videos of White Wolf Games from my play group<br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCBUyj7h-xIhwsM3kHK56SRA\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCBU...IhwsM3kHK56SRA</a><br /> <a href=\"https://soundcloud.com/twin-cities-by-night\" target=\"_blank\">https://soundcloud.com/twin-cities-by-night</a><br /> If you want to find White Wolf game play media or subject matter media<br /> <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/groups/862703457198327/\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.facebook.com/groups/862703457198327/</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11618-christopherzacher","name":"ChristopherZacher","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11618_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"631"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}